        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The AXIS, Planet Hollywood Las Vegas, Las Vegas Strip, Las Vegas, Nevada, United States\n- Organizations: Caesars Entertainment Corporation\n- Events: Miss Universe 2015, Miss Dominican Republic 2015\n- Topics: sponsorship naming\n\nFacts:\n- The AXIS is a mid-sized auditorium located at Planet Hollywood Las Vegas on the Las Vegas Strip.\n- The AXIS is also known as The AXIS powered by Monster for sponsorship purposes and as the AXIS Theater.\n- Planet Hollywood Las Vegas is owned and operated by Caesars Entertainment Corporation.\n- Miss Universe 2015 was the 64th Miss Universe pageant and was held on 20 December 2015 at The AXIS in Las Vegas, Nevada, United States.\n- The winner of Miss Dominican Republic 2015 represented the Dominican Republic in Miss Universe 2015.",
